# Stage-B part 3 on PUBLIC Monad testnet: continues from part 2 (run stage-b-android-20261008-203746, steps 07b and 08
# passed): the test user (mirror-b) still holds the position it kept after detaching; the demo leader is flat.

step 09 the test user closes the kept position themselves (Close all, one passkey prompt)
device b
install
launch
waitFor id:onboarding.screen 60
tap id:onboarding.restore
passkey 90 "^Probe 2026-10-06"
waitFor id:restore.go.home 120
tap id:restore.go.home
open /funds
readText id:funds.address addrB "^0x[0-9a-fA-F ]{40,60}$" 30
squash addrB
open /home
tap id:home.tab.portfolio
tap id:portfolio.closeAll
waitFor id:closeAll.dialog 10
tap id:portfolio.closeAll.confirm
passkey 90
expectResult id:portfolio.positions.count "^0$" 120
shell ${HOOK} lots ${addrB} lotsAfter
assertVar lotsAfter "^0$"

step 10 the test user withdraws back to the wallet (one passkey prompt)
open /withdraw
tap id:withdraw.max 20
tap id:withdraw.continue
waitFor id:withdraw.sheet 10
tap id:withdraw.confirm
passkey 90
expectResult id:withdraw.status "^Confirmed$" 180
shell ${HOOK} wallet ${addrB}

step 11 demo leader opens at 10x -> the demo follower's 2x rule blocks it onchain (watch feed, mirror-a)
device a
launch
waitFor id:onboarding.screen 60
tap id:onboarding.restore
passkey 90 "^Mirror probe 2026-10-06"
waitFor id:restore.go.home 120
tap id:restore.go.home
shell ${HOOK} leader-trade open 20 1000
open /home
scrollTo "idtext:watch\.feed\.\d+~Not copied"
expectResult "idtext:watch\.feed\.\d+~Not copied" "leverage" 120
shell ${HOOK} leader-trade close 20
